      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Not necessarily a bug, and I argue it isn't one. Instance lists from Photon servers are separate from your social status and API.\n\nFriends+/Friends/Group/Group+ are also considered private instances, but are discoverable via Photon with permissions.\n\nInvite/Invite+ instances are not discoverable without an invite.\n\nDuplicate of:\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/orange-status-requires-no-invite\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/friends-can-bypass-ask-me-status-through-world-menu\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/you-can-join-friends-when-they-are-in-friends-on-orange-red",
